## Team Norms
- Start earlier (no 5 minute early submissions).
- Inform others if you cannot work for any reason when theres looming work. 
- Communicate clearly for any reason
    - ex. dont like the idea
    - are falling behind
    - pull requests
- Be realistic
- This is all of our app, don't seperate into 3 distinct parts 
    - ex. "luca fucked this up thats just him"
- Be proud of our work
- conflict management
    - communicate
    - find middleground
    - ask everyone for input 
    - fps chess 1v1 (if its just a fun argument)


